OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy and dull start
OL,6,Fwith perhaps the odd spot of rain
OL,7,Faround. Skies will gradually brighten,
OL,8,Fespecially throughout the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith some sunshine developing.
OL,10,FTemperatures near average but feeling
OL,11,Frather cool in the easterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSkies continuing to clear
OL,14,Fthis evening, leading to a cold start
OL,15,Fto the night with some pockets of fog
OL,16,Fand frost. Thicker cloud may return
OL,17,Ffrom the east towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
