OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA rather cloudy day with the
OL,6,Fcloud thick enough to produce some
OL,7,Flight spots of rain. Best of any
OL,8,Fbrightness to the west of high ground.
OL,9,FTemperatures remaining around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,12,Fcloudy Friday and over the weekend. A
OL,13,Fsmall chance of rain at times,
OL,14,Fespecially later Saturday.
OL,15,FTemperatures near average, with
OL,16,Fovernight frost possible during any
OL,17,Fclearer spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
